                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "My visit to this unagi restaurant was well worth the 30-minute wait during a busy weekday lunch hour. They have a convenient mobile queuing system that lets you track your turn, which made the wait much more manageable. The unagi rice was delicious and incredibly satisfying, a true highlight of the meal. It\u0027s a great option if you are around Lalaport.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
